      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm of David. The earth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD'S, and the fullness thereof; the world, and they that dwell therein.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.24.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.24.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he hath founded it upon the seas, and established it upon the floods.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.24.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.24.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who shall ascend upon the hill of the LORD? and who shall stand in his holy place?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.24.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.24.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that hath clean hands, and a pure heart; who hath not lifted up his soul to vanity, nor sworn deceitfully.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.24.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.24.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He shall receive the blessing from the LORD, and righteousness from the God of his salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.24.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.24.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the generation of them that seek him, that seek thy face, O Jacob. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.24.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.24.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lift up your heads, O ye gates; and be ye lifted up, ye everlasting doors; and the King of glory shall come in.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.24.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.24.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " this King of glory? the LORD strong and mighty, the LORD mighty in battle.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.24.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.24.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lift up your heads, O ye gates; even lift ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " up, ye everlasting doors; and the King of glory shall come in.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.24.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.24.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who is this King of glory? the LORD of hosts, he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the King of glory. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
